# Pattern Implementation Guide

This guide explains how to implement new design patterns in the project.

## Directory Structure

Each pattern should be implemented in its own directory under the appropriate category:

```
src/
  [category]/
    [pattern-name]/
      [pattern-name].ts        # Main implementation
      __tests__/              # Test files
        [pattern-name].test.ts
      README.md              # Documentation
```

## Implementation Steps

1. Create the pattern directory under the appropriate category
2. Create the main implementation file
3. Add tests in the `__tests__` directory
4. Add documentation in README.md
5. Update the main index file to export the pattern

## Documentation Requirements

Each pattern's README.md should include:

- Pattern description
- Use cases
- Implementation details
- Configuration options
- Usage examples
- Related patterns

